35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, the shuffles took two weeks each! That’s a long time to be in limbo. Let’s plan carefully so we don’t repeat that chaos.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
